      ],
      "movement": "look_around"
    },
    {
      "id": "beauty",
      "name": "Beauty",
      "npcType": "Lady",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 15,
      "facing": "Right",
      "dialog": [
        "The very same Accessory can make quite different impressions.",
        "It all depends on where it is put, and how."
      ],
      "movement": "look_around"
    },
    {
      "id": "lass",
      "name": "Lass",
      "npcType": "lass",
      "x": 13,
      "y": 15,
      "facing": "Left",
      "dialog": [
        "A nice lady downstairs gave me a Backdrop once. For nothing!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expert_f",
      "name": "Old Lady",
      "npcType": "Lady",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 14,
      "facing": "Left",
      "dialog": [
        "Oh, dear me! Gracious! Why, it's very nearly scandalous!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hiker",
      "name": "Hiker",
      "npcType": "Gentleman",
      "x": 5,
      "y": 8,
      "facing": "Right",
      "dialog": [
        "Peeking into other people's PC Boxes gives me a guilty sort of thrill.",
        "It's a pleasure I'd rather nobody knew about. ...Never mind that standing here rather gives me away."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "idol",
      "name": "Idol",
      "npcType": "Lass",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 11,
      "facing": "Right",
      "dialog": [
        "I come every day to see what everybody's Dress-Up Data looks like.",
        "For me, it's the first step to being fashionable!"
      ],
      "movement": "wander_around",
      "rangeX": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "artist",
      "name": "Artist",
      "npcType": "Gentleman",
      "x": 7,
      "y": 4,
      "facing": "Down",
      "dialog": [
        "It's an outrage! Why are there only pictures of Pokémon?",
        "Why none of the ladies? I call that unfair!"
